nixio
------------------------------------------
C++ library for storing scientific data in the NIX data model.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libboost_filesystem1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_regex1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_system1.66-1.66.0-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libhdf5_320-2.2.0-1
  libnixio-devel-1.5.0+git20230213-1bl1
  libnixio1-1.5.0+git20230213-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cppunit-1.13.2-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  hdf5-2.2.0-1
  libaec-devel-1.1.8-1
  libboost-devel-1.66.0-1
  libhdf5-devel-2.2.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://g-node.github.io/nix/

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/G-Node/nix.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack nixio-1.5.0+git20230213-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./nixio-1.5.0+git20230213-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/nixio-1.5.0+git20230213-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/nixio-1.5.0+git20230213-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnixio1-1.5.0+git20230213-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnixio-devel-1.5.0+git20230213-X.tar.xz

